---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Omni" description="A short snapshot of who I am and how I work.">
  <section class="surface p-8">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
      Builder, writer, relentless simplifier.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">
      I like making small things that feel intentional. I move quickly but leave space for calm,
      iterative work. This site is a public notebook for experiments, references, and what I am
      learning along the way.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="surface p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Working style</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
        <li>Default to small, shippable scopes with clear constraints.</li>
        <li>Prefer static-first stacks and readable TypeScript.</li>
        <li>Document as I go so others can reuse the patterns.</li>
        <li>Keep interfaces uncluttered: a bit like an operating system desktop.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="surface p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">What I enjoy</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
        <li>Designing resilient foundations that stay simple at scale.</li>
        <li>Writing short essays about process, craft, and focus.</li>
        <li>Automating repetitive workflows for creative work.</li>
        <li>Helping teams set up calm defaults for building and shipping.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8 surface p-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Now page</h2>
    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
      <p>🔧 Shipping: a minimal status dashboard for personal projects.</p>
      <p>✍️ Writing: short notes on process and deep work.</p>
      <p>🤝 Open to: pairing on small tools, design systems, and documentation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
